Every page in the corpus is original prose written for this benchmark. Of the
content-management products it compares against Drupal, two are real (WordPress,
Joomla) and four are fictional (Hexagrid, Lumen CMS, Marrow, Sitewright); any
resemblance of a fictional name to a real product is unintended. Drupal is a
registered trademark of Dries Buytaert; WordPress is a trademark of the WordPress
Foundation; Joomla is a trademark of Open Source Matters, Inc. The real names are
used only to identify the products being compared, and nothing in the pages is a
statement of fact about them beyond what is common knowledge.
